      "timestamp_sec": 753,
      "why": "Shows why output-level safety checks miss the actual harm surface."
    },
    {
      "text": "Solomon Heikes um last year this conference called an AI agent, an LLM that's wrecking its environment in a loop.",
      "timestamp_sec": 790,
      "why": "Endorses a specific, contrarian definition of 'agent'."
    },
    {
