    },
    {
      "text": "in some sense what we're doing, we're air gapping the agentic loop from the agent. So we don't let the agent run the agentic loop. Before the agent run it, we want to be able to check it.",
      "timestamp_sec": 880,
      "why": "Names the design pattern the talk is advocating."
    },
    {
